-  // ---------- camera framing + fly-in ----------
-  // The camera always sits at (lookAt + dist*ISO_DIR) — dollying along a
-  // fixed isometric direction while the frustum size (vs) and the look
-  // target change is what makes "zoom to the whole town" and "fly in to
-  // one plot" feel like the same camera, not two different modes.
